@module_doc("""
Host handles: references to objects a host owns.

See [host handles](game-engine-features/handles.md).
""")

# Package `core`, module `handle` (core/src/builtins/handle.rs).
#
# Native interface declarations: each `native fn` binds a name to the host
# native of the same name and gives the checker its parameter names, arity
# and types. Several declarations of one name are that native's call forms.
# See docs/usage/ffi.md (Native interfaces).

@doc("""
Whether the value is a [host handle](game-engine-features/handles.md) whose
object the host still considers alive. Never an error: `nil`, a value that
is not a handle and a stale handle are all `false`. Why a handle can go
stale between two frames is in
[game-engine-features/frame-contract.md](game-engine-features/frame-contract.md#engine-objects).
""",
  example: """
    is_valid(nil)   # false
  """)
pub native fn is_valid(handle)
